    "detailed_description": "This game requires Oculus Quest. If you do not have the device, you cannot use it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou become a member of the rift investigation team and explore the unknown rift.<br />\r\nCollect dinosaur eggs while avoiding the dangerous dinosaurs there.<br />\r\nYou can hatch dinosaur eggs to create your own dinosaur garden.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can explore jungle, desert, and swamp areas.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse capture bullets to collect resources and dinosaur eggs.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDinosaurs can't see you, but they react to moving objects or sounds.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can use lures, flashes, and smoke bombs to escape dangerous situations or make gathering easier.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollect points to get upgraded and enjoy a great vacation!!",
    "about_the_game": "This game requires Oculus Quest. If you do not have the device, you cannot use it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou become a member of the rift investigation team and explore the unknown rift.<br />\r\nCollect dinosaur eggs while avoiding the dangerous dinosaurs there.<br />\r\nYou can hatch dinosaur eggs to create your own dinosaur garden.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can explore jungle, desert, and swamp areas.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse capture bullets to collect resources and dinosaur eggs.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDinosaurs can't see you, but they react to moving objects or sounds.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can use lures, flashes, and smoke bombs to escape dangerous situations or make gathering easier.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollect points to get upgraded and enjoy a great vacation!!",
    "short_description": "An unknown crack resembling the Mesozoic Era discovered in the near future. Collect dinosaur eggs while avoiding the eyes of dangerous dinosaurs. Collect dinosaur eggs and hatch them to collect dinosaurs!! Collect points to get upgraded and enjoy a great vacation!!",
